# Dark Samus: the dive out of the boost ball (fn_10_9424) and the dive's static wall hit
# (fn_10_11FA4 at 0x00012534). Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2, boss u04f7.
#
# Run it at the game's real speed (MP2_FRAME_LIMIT=1, no MP2_TICKS_PER_FRAME): the dive
# launches about 167 ticks after the state change and the flight lasts about 20 ticks, so the
# placement has to land in that window. The boost bit 0x01 (the dive record's 0xB20) is what
# skips the collision failsafe (0x00012018), which would otherwise put an actor placed in a
# wall back at its safe position before the static collision test runs.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f700 fsm u04f7 DiveFromBoost
@f872 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f880 objs darksamus
@f900 objs darksamus
@f940 objs darksamus
@f980 objs darksamus
